        <mxCell id="lgflow" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;The flow, in one line:&lt;/b&gt; the agent &lt;b&gt;proposes&lt;/b&gt; (cart + consent session), the human &lt;b&gt;authorizes&lt;/b&gt; on the Trusted Surface (/intent → /confirm), and the infrastructure &lt;b&gt;settles&lt;/b&gt; (Mandate Authority signs both mandates → CP issues a single-use credential → Merchant drives the MPP, which re-verifies the whole chain before any money moves).&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#232F3E;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
